n></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Theorem 6.1.15; same-ultrafilter construction at start of proof"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>398</span><span>399</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>414</span><span>415</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof opening checked"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-1.7.1"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structures)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_L\">\\(\\equiv_L\\)</span> (elementary equivalence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bdfdb62527f9710d\" href=\"?note=bdfdb62527f9710d\" title=\"17-df-elementary-equivalence\">17-df-elementary-equivalence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9e920083cdf9b067\" href=\"?note=9e920083cdf9b067\" title=\"17-df-ultrafilter\">17-df-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L\\)</span> (ultrapower predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bbcb80a62faf05ea\" href=\"?note=bbcb80a62faf05ea\" title=\"17-df-ultrapower\">17-df-ultrapower</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span> (structure isomorphism, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9f3187e8ff79e64e\" href=\"?note=9f3187e8ff79e64e\" title=\"17-df-isomorphism\">17-df-isomorphism</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\equiv_L\\mathfrak B\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists I\\,\\exists U\\,\\exists\\mathfrak A^\\ast\\,\\exists\\mathfrak B^\\ast\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak A,I,U,\\mathfrak A^\\ast)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak B,I,U,\\mathfrak B^\\ast)\n\\land\n\\mathfrak A^\\ast\\cong\\mathfrak B^\\ast\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\equiv_L\\mathfrak B\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists I\\,\\exists U\\,\\exists\\mathfrak A^\\ast\\,\\exists\\mathfrak B^\\ast\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak A,I,U,\\mathfrak A^\\ast)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak B,I,U,\\mathfrak B^\\ast)\n\\land\n\\mathfrak A^\\ast\\cong\\mathfrak B^\\ast\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The theorem asserts the existence of a common index set and ultrafilter; it does not identify an ultrapower with a carrier quotient before the induced structure has been specified.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-elementary-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"bdfdb62527f9710d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"9e920083cdf9b067","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrapower","status":"resolved","id":"bbcb80a62faf05ea","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultrapower]]","embed":f